<lb n="56"/>unnd derglichen ledlen ußgeben haben, derhalb:
<lb n="57"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanngt</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>: unnd nach:
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">parliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbiges</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear>:
<lb n="59"/>haltung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachparschafft</unclear>, ouch das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darby</unclear>
<lb n="60"/>alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witloueffigkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erspart</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dhein</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">byrseits</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verniten</unclear> blyben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ledlen</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>Ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keßler</unclear> widerumb gnedig unnd guenstig
<lb n="63"/>verfolgen laßen, damit ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ieden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear>
<lb n="64"/>des ordts halber angewendten schadts. klid
<lb n="65"/>unnd blediget. unnd soelichs an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">altem</unclear> ouch
<lb n="66"/>widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moege</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demselbigen</unclear> Inn
<lb n="67"/>glichen unnd andr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begebennder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fellen</unclear> zube:
<lb n="68"/>gegnen, Tund wir unns alß Iederzyt fuer:
<lb n="69"/>bietung, ganz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>: unnd nachparlich,
<lb n="70"/>damit unnß samptlich Gottes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Allmacht</unclear> wol:
